                        "content": "A client is having difficulty coughing and deep breathing because of pain after a nephrectomy. Which action by the nurse is helpful in promoting optimal respiratory function?",
                        "subjectId": "ad5ab04c79144c0ea9b83385308c3b1d",
                        "difficultyIds": "80db17ea97ed8fdcd1b6b9666390fca1",
                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Applying 应用",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nThe client who has had a nephrectomy may have pain with coughing and deep breathing and other respiratory exercises because the location of the incision is so close to the diaphragm. The nurse assists the client by offering opioid analgesics when due, encouraging incentive spirometer use hourly, and assisting the client to splint the incision during coughing. If the client takes pain medication only before ambulation, control of pain may be insufficient, which will not promote optimal respiratory function (pain medication would be offered 30 to 45 minutes before the client ambulates). Laparoscopic nephrectomy can also be performed. Compared to conventional nephrectomy, the laparoscopic approach is less painful and requires no sutures or staples, involves a shorter hospital stay, and has a much faster recovery.",
                        "id": "1d25aee7678a4fb0866b6757ee7ba22e",
                        "mark": "0",
                        "collectionState": "0"
                    },
                    {
                        "optionList": [
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "52e7eb70688b42128d1d71ca39675145",
                                "content": "“I avoid canned and boxed foods.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "f7d62076c310493d845a0ea5a19b4823",
                                "content": "“I check my blood pressure at the same time each day.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "1",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "f61ad230f6d34f9c964f675444bd8d4f",
                                "content": "“I take ibuprofen if my back starts to hurt, which helps a lot.”"
                            },
